{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2022b.q25.material.recovered", "text": "材料：单元测验后，李老师照例上了一堂讲评课，上课不到十分钟，她就发现那几位考满分的学生表现出不耐烦和心不在焉。于是，她及时调整了教学策略：每讲一道题，就请做对的学生将自己答题的思路和方法讲给其他同学听，不明白的可以随时提问，然后进行讨论，结果，这节课上得生动、活泼，不仅将学生的积极性调动起来了，还产生了许多新的解题思路和方法。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d993261f9f8d870d1fe83d4975090ea53d4f633002ba9e78a7ec1a909633e675", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1965, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2129, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d993261f9f8d870d1fe83d4975090ea53d4f633002ba9e78a7ec1a909633e675"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2022b.q25"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k02", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.design", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r031", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045", "ntce.outline.202.r046"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2022b.q25"], "word_count": 164, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d993261f9f8d870d1fe83d4975090ea53d4f633002ba9e78a7ec1a909633e675", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1965, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2129, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学